<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Amundsen returns three weeks after spraining his right ankle. The swelling has gone, he walks normally with the brace, and he stopped the diclofenac gel after two weeks. He did not take tramadol. His average finger pain over the past week is 2 of 10, and he has had no drowsiness on duloxetine. He has been asked to join an Arctic air search for the missing crew of an airship, flying over the sea ice, and he wants to discuss the medical risks before he decides. He has had no chest pain, palpitations, or breathlessness. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Finger pain</td><td>Average 2 of 10 over the past week</td></tr><tr><td>Ankle</td><td>Walking normally in the brace; gel stopped after two weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Medicine effects</td><td>No drowsiness or dizziness</td></tr><tr><td>Question</td><td>Medical risks of an Arctic air search flight</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

